    "caption": "Panna Cotta might seem intimidating to create on your own, but trust us when we say this version of the classic Italian dessert is a breeze to prepare.\n\nWe used Torani Hazelnut Syrup to give the Panna Cotta more depth in flavour and to complement the creamy vanilla base. The addition of dark chocolate adds a familiar sweetness to this indulgent dessert. Don’t forget to make this a day in advance to give the gelatin ample time to set. As they say, patience is a virtue, and we promise you, it is so worth it. \n\nAll the ingredients you need are available at #TheMarketplace!",
